{"version":1,"slug":"Others__Quantitative_Aptitude_-_General_Quant_-_SSC_SUPER_PRACTICE_40078_(20Q)","path":"Others/Quantitative Aptitude - General Quant - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 40078 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"Quantitative Aptitude - General Quant - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 40078 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If [(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1 and [(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3, then what is the value of [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>]?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; [(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1 &#2324;&#2352; [(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3, &#2340;&#2379; [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>] &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(9/4)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(9/4)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(13/4)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(13/4)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(17/4)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(17/4)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(13/7)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(13/7)</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>[(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1</p><p>Let (a/x) = p and (b/y) = q</p><p>(p + q) = 1 ......... (1)</p><p>[(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3</p><p>(1/p) + (1/q) = -4/3</p><p>(q + p)pq = -4/3</p><p>1/pq = -4/3</p><p>pq = -3/4 ........ (2)</p><p>= [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>= [p<sup>3</sup> + q<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>= (p + q)<sup>3</sup>  -  3pq(p + q)</p><p>From equations (1) and (2)-</p><p>= 1<sup>3</sup>  -  3 * (-3/4) * (1)</p><p>= 1 + (9/4)</p><p>= (13/4)</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If <img width=145 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image011.png\">, <img width=132 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image012.png\">, and <img width=145 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image013.png\">, then what is the value of (P  X  Q &div; R)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <img width=145 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image011.png\">, <img width=132 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image012.png\">, &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; <img width=145 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image013.png\">, &#2340;&#2379; (P X Q &div; R) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(5x  -  3y)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(5x  -  3y)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(3x  -  2y)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(3x  -  2y)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(x + 3y)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(x + 3y)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p><img width=403 height=141 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16669/image014.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (4m + n)/(3m + 4n) = 4/7, then what is the value of <img width=104 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18075/image006.png\">?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (4m + n)/(3m + 4n) = 4/7, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?<img width=104 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18075/image006.png\">?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">5/6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5/6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3/10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">7/10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7/10</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>(4m + n)/(3m + 4n) = 4/7</p><p>=&gt; 28m + 7n = 12m + 16n</p><p>=&gt; 16m = 9n</p><p>=&gt; m/n = 9/16</p><p>Let m = 9k and n = 16k</p><p>So,</p><p><img width=104 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18075/image006.png\"></p><p>= 40/41 * ((9k)<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 9k * 16k)/(3*(16k)<sup>2</sup> + 3 * 9k * 16k)</p><p>= 40/41 * 123/400</p><p>= 3/10</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If p<sup>2</sup>/q<sup>2</sup> + q<sup>2</sup>/p<sup>2</sup> = 254, then find p/q + q/p?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; p<sup>2</sup>/q<sup>2</sup> + q<sup>2</sup>/p<sup>2</sup> = 254, &#2340;&#2379; p/q + q/p &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#177;16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#177;16</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-16</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">32</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">32</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>p<sup>2</sup>/q<sup>2</sup> + q<sup>2</sup>/p<sup>2</sup> = 254</p><p>p<sup>2</sup>/q<sup>2</sup> + q<sup>2</sup>/p<sup>2</sup> + 2 = 254 + 2</p><p>(p/q)<sup>2</sup> + (q/p)<sup>2</sup> + 2*(p/q)(q/p) = 256</p><p>(p/q + q/p)<sup>2</sup> = 16<sup>2</sup></p><p>p/q + q/p = &#177;16</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 9x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 58, and 3x  -  y = -4, then find the value of 2xy.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 9x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 58, &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 3x - y = -4, &#2340;&#2379; 2xy &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">11</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Given, 3x  -  y = -4</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>9x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  6xy = 16</p><p>58  -  6xy = 16</p><p>6xy = 42</p><p>2xy = 14.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what value of k will be following system of equations have infinite solution? </p><p>15x  -  ky = 20, 6x + 7y = 8</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>k &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>15x - ky = 20, 6x + 7y = 8</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">-  17.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-  17.5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-  18.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-  18.5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-  16.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-  16.5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-  19.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-  19.5</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>15x  -  ky = 20</p><p>6x + 7y = 8</p><p>For infinite solutions:</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a<sub>2</sub> = b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub> = c<sub>1</sub>/c<sub>2</sub> </p><p>15/6 = -k/7 = 20/8</p><p>-k/7 = 5/2</p><p>k = -17.5</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what value of k will be following system of equations have no solution? </p><p>7x + 4y = 9, ky + 28x = 5</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>k &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2361;&#2354; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>7x + 4y = 9, ky + 28x = 5</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">49</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">49</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">21</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Rearranging the equation:</p><p>7x + 4y = 9</p><p>28x + ky = 5</p><p>For no solution:</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a<sub>2</sub> = b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub> &#8800; c<sub>1</sub>/c<sub>2</sub> </p><p>7/28 = 4/k &#8800; 9/5</p><p>7/28 = 4/k</p><p>k = 16</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup>  -  by<sup>3</sup>), then find the value of (a + b  -  ab).</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2x - 4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup> - by<sup>3</sup>) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (a + b - ab) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">-5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-2</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Given,</p><p>(2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup>  -  by<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>LHS = (2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (2x  -  4y)[(2x)<sup>2</sup> + (2x) * (4y) + (4y)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>= (2x)<sup>3</sup>  -  (4y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 8x<sup>3</sup>  -  64y<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 8(x<sup>3</sup>  -  8y<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>Now compare with RHS,</p><p>We get 4a = 8 or a = 2 and b = 8</p><p>The value of (a + b  -  ab) = (2 + 8  -  16) = 10  -  16 = -6.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 729X<sup>3</sup>  -  125Y<sup>3</sup> = (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup>  -  DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY) where A, B, C and D are integers, then what is the value of 7A + B  -  C - D?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 729X<sup>3</sup> - 125Y<sup>3</sup> = (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup> - DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; A, B, C &#2324;&#2352; D &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; 7A + B - C - D &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>729X<sup>3</sup>  -  125Y<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 729X<sup>3</sup> + (-125Y<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>= (9X)<sup>3</sup> + (-5Y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= (9X - 5Y)(81X<sup>2</sup> + 25Y<sup>2</sup> + 45XY)</p><p>= (9X + (-5)Y)(81X<sup>2</sup>  -  (-25Y<sup>2</sup>) + 45XY)</p><p>= (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup>  -  DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY),</p><p>Therefore A = 9, B = -5, C = 81, D = -25</p><p>7A + B  -  C - D = 63  -  5  -  81 + 25 = 58  -  56 = 2</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (2x  -  3y)<sup>2 </sup> -  (2x + y)<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = y(ay  -  bx), then find the value of a + b.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2x - 3y)<sup>2 </sup> - (2x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 2xy = y(ay - bx) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; a + b &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">22</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">26</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">26</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">30</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">30</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>We know, (a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2ab</p><p>And, (a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2ab</p><p>Here, (2x  -  3y)<sup>2 </sup> -  (2x + y)<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = y(ay  -  bx)</p><p>(4x<sup>2</sup> + 9y<sup>2</sup>  -  12xy)  -  (4x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 4xy)  -  2xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup> + 9y<sup>2</sup>  -  12xy  -  4x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup>  -  4xy  -  2xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>8y<sup>2</sup>  -  18xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>Comparing coefficients of y<sup>2</sup> and xy in the above equation we get</p><p>a = 8, b = 18</p><p>Therefore, a + b = 8 + 18 = <b>26</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>(x/y) + (y/x) = P and (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = 0, then find the value of P. [where (x + y) &#8800; 0]</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(x/y) + (y/x) = P &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = 0 &#2361;&#2376; , &#2340;&#2379; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; |(&#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; (x + y) &#8800; 0)</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>(x/y) + (y/x) = P</p><p>(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>) = Pxy</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  Pxy = 0 ..... (1)</p><p>Now, (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = 0</p><p>=&gt; (x + y)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy) = 0</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy = 0 ..... (2) [(x + y) &#8800; 0]</p><p>Compare equation (1) and (2)-</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  Pxy = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy</p><p>=&gt; P = 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If X<sup>2</sup> = 202  -  Y<sup>2</sup>, and X = 2 + Y, then find the value of XY.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X<sup>2</sup> = 202 - Y<sup>2 </sup>&#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; X = 2 + Y &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; XY &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">99</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">99</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">120</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">120</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">63</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">63</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">80</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">80</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>X<sup>2</sup> = 202  -  Y<sup>2</sup></p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = 202... (1)</p><p>X = 2 + Y</p><p>X  -  Y = 2</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> - 2XY = 4</p><p>202  -  2XY = 4</p><p>198 = 2XY</p><p>XY = 99</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what value of (x, y), x  -  2y = 11 and x<sup>2</sup> + 81 = 18x? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(x, y), x - 2y = 11 &#2324;&#2352; x<sup>2</sup> + 81 = 18x &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(9, -1)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(9, -1)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(9, 3)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(9, 3)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(6, -3)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(6, -3)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(6, 1)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(6, 1)</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 81 = 18x</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  18x + 81 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  9x  -  9x + 81 = 0</p><p>(x  -  9)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>x = 9</p><p>Now, x  -  2y = 11</p><p>9  -  2y = 11</p><p>y = -1</p><p>Therefore, (x, y) = <b>(9, -1)</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 2X  -  Y = 6, and 4X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = 60, then find the value of 8X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup>.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2X - Y = 6 &#2324;&#2352; 4X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = 60 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 8X<sup>3</sup> - Y<sup>3</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">432</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">432</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-185</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-185</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">180</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">180</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Given,</p><p>2X  -  Y = 6</p><p>Square both sides,</p><p>4X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup>  -  4XY = 36</p><p>60  -  4XY = 36</p><p>4XY = 60  -  36</p><p>4XY = 24</p><p>XY = 6</p><p>Given,</p><p>2X  -  Y = 6</p><p>Cube both sides,</p><p>8X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup>  -  3* 2X * Y * (2X  -  Y) = 216</p><p>8X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup>  -  6 * 6 * 6 = 216</p><p>8X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup> = 216 + 216</p><p>8X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup> = 432</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (a + b) = 2 and (a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>) = 6, then what is the value of (a<sup>2</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup>)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (a + b) = 2 &#2324;&#2352; (a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup>) = 6 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>(a<sup>2</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup>)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (a  -  b)(a + b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (a + b)(a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>= 2 * 6</p><p>= <b>12</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 193 and xy = 84, then find the value of x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup>.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 193 &#2324;&#2352; xy = 84 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> - y<sup>3 </sup>&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1385</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1385</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1650</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1650</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1260</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1260</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1184</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1184</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 193 and xy = 84</p><p>(x  -  y)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = 193  -  2*84 = 25</p><p>x  -  y = 5</p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> = (x  -  y)<sup>3</sup> + 3xy(x - y)</p><p>= (5)<sup>3</sup> + 3*84*(5)</p><p>= 5*(25 + 252)</p><p>= 1385</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 84 and ab = 30, and a, b&gt;0. Find the value of (a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>).</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 84 &#2324;&#2352; ab = 30 &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; a, b&gt;0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">745</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">745</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">564</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">564</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">648</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">648</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">450</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">450</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 84 and ab = 30</p><p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2ab</p><p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> = 84 + 2*30 = 84 + 60 = 144</p><p>a + b = 12</p><p>(a + b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 3ab(a + b)</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> = 12<sup>3</sup>  -  3*30*12</p><p>= 12(144-90)</p><p>= 12*54</p><p>= 648</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>(2x + 3y)/(3x  -  2y) = 3/4, then what is the value of (x<sup>2</sup> + 2y<sup>2</sup>)/(x<sup>2</sup>  -  4y<sup>2</sup>)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(2x + 3y)/(3x - 2y) = 3/4 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x<sup>2</sup> + 2y<sup>2</sup>)/(x<sup>2</sup> - 4y<sup>2</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">129/120</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">129/120</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">177/160</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">177/160</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">163/160</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">163/160</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">172/161</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">172/161</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>(2x + 3y)/(3x  -  2y) = 3/4</p><p>=&gt; 8x + 12y = 9x  -  6y</p><p>=&gt; 18y = x</p><p>=&gt; x/y = 18/1</p><p>=&gt; x = 18k and y = k</p><p>Hence, (x<sup>2</sup> + 2y<sup>2</sup>)/(3x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup>) = ((18k)<sup>2</sup> + 2(k)<sup>2</sup>)/((18k)<sup>2</sup>  -  4(k)<sup>2</sup>) = (324k<sup>2</sup> + 2k<sup>2</sup>)/(324k<sup>2</sup>  -  4k<sup>2</sup>) = 326/320 = 163/160</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 3a + 2b = 4 and 27a<sup>3</sup> + 8b<sup>3</sup> = 8, then what is the value of 3a(3a  -  2b) + 4b<sup>2</sup>?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 3a + 2b = 4 &#2324;&#2352; 27a<sup>3</sup> + 8b<sup>3</sup> = 8 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 3a(3a - 2b) + 4b<sup>2 </sup>&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>We know, (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = (x + y)(x<sup>2</sup>  -  xy + y<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Here, x = 3a, y = 2b</p><p>27a<sup>3</sup> + 8b<sup>3</sup> = (3a + 2b)(9a<sup>2</sup>  -  6ab + 4b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>Now,</p><p>3a(3a  -  2b) + 4b<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9a<sup>2</sup>  -  6ab + 4b<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (27a<sup>3</sup> + 8b<sup>3</sup>)/(3a + 2b)</p><p>= 8/4</p><p>= <b>2</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If X + Y = 23 and XY = 112, then what is the value of X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup>? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X + Y = 23 &#2324;&#2352; XY = 112 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">4430</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4430</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3439</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3439</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4439</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4439</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4450</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4450</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup> = (X + Y) (X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup>) </p><p>= 23 [(X<sup> </sup>+ Y)<sup>2</sup>  -  3XY]</p><p>= 23 (23<sup>2</sup>  -  3 * 112)</p><p>= 23 * 193</p><p>= 4439</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}